Subject: [PATCH] java: complete FieldGeneratorInfo/OneofGeneratorInfo in context.h

Context declares `absl::flat_hash_map<const FieldDescriptor*, FieldGeneratorInfo>`
and `absl::flat_hash_map<const OneofDescriptor*, OneofGeneratorInfo>` members while
those structs are only forward-declared (they are defined in field_common.h).
Abseil's open-addressing containers compute trivial-type traits on the map's
value_type at class instantiation, which requires the value type to be complete.
Clang with libstdc++ evaluates these eagerly and fails to build:

    stl_pair.h: error: field has incomplete type 'FieldGeneratorInfo'
    type_traits: static_assert failed ... __is_complete_or_unbounded

Include field_common.h so both structs are complete at the point of the map
declarations.
--- a/src/google/protobuf/compiler/java/context.h
+++ b/src/google/protobuf/compiler/java/context.h
@@ -12,4 +12,5 @@
 #include <vector>
 
 #include "absl/container/flat_hash_map.h"
+#include "google/protobuf/compiler/java/field_common.h"
 #include "google/protobuf/compiler/java/helpers.h"
